AV.ONE INSTALL COMMANDS LIST
=============================

Command:
  (run these in order on Ubuntu 22.04 jammy)

Install Commands:


Ros2 Humble Install Doc:
    https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation/Alternatives/Ubuntu-Development-Setup.html
  

• Gazebo + ros2_control bridge
  sudo apt install -y \
    ros-humble-ros-gz \
    ros-humble-gz-ros2-control

• Control + navigation + tools
  sudo apt install -y \
    ros-humble-controller-manager \
    ros-humble-ros2-control \
    ros-humble-ros2-controllers \
    ros-humble-joint-state-publisher \
    ros-humble-joint-state-publisher-gui \
    ros-humble-robot-localization \
    ros-humble-navigation2 \
    ros-humble-nav2-bringup \
    ros-humble-nav2-lifecycle-manager \
    ros-humble-topic-tools

• ROSIDL typesupport (critical)
  sudo apt install -y \
    ros-humble-rosidl-typesupport-c \
    ros-humble-rosidl-typesupport-cpp

• Build + Python tooling
  sudo apt install -y \
    build-essential \
    cmake \
    git \
    cython3 \
    python3-dev \
    python3-pip \
    python3-colcon-common-extensions \
    python3-vcstool \
    python3-argcomplete \
    python3-ament-package

• rosdep
  sudo apt install -y python3-rosdep
  sudo rosdep init 2>/dev/null || true
  rosdep update

• Python ML deps (user install)
  pip3 uninstall -y numpy || true
  pip3 install --user "numpy<2.0"
  pip3 install --user --upgrade ultralytics tf-transformations


====================
AV.ONE ENVIRONMENT COMMANDS
====================

Commands:

  # Optional: use CycloneDDS
  export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_cyclonedds_cpp

  # Match AV.ONE network settings, THIS ALLOWS ROS TOPICS OVER THE NETWORK
  export ROS_DOMAIN_ID=42 
  export ROS_LOCALHOST_ONLY=0


  # Default to Fast-DDS (clear any override)
  unset RMW_IMPLEMENTATION

  # Source ROS 2 Humble
  source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash

  # Source workspace overlay (if it exists)
  source ~/ros2_ws/install/setup.bash

